# Claude Code: session-local runtime state is ignored, but the project's permission
# rules (settings.json) are committed so they bind every agent working in this repo.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Supplier deliverable — copied into docs/design/ and packages/three-adapter/reference/,
# deleted from the working tree once the port is finished. Nothing may depend on it.
design-source/

# `next dev` regenerates apps/web/AGENTS.md and apps/web/CLAUDE.md whenever it detects an AI
# coding agent (next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js, gated on getAgentName()). It keys
# on the Next project directory, so a root-level AGENTS.md cannot satisfy it and there is no
# config opt-out. This repository keeps exactly ONE tracked pair, at the root: agent guidance is
# routed from there, and a second file under apps/web would silently split it.
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
